            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In this guide, ReNUWIt (UC-Berkeley) graduate students Emily Cook and Casey Finnerty offer insights and suggestions for students applying to the National Science Foundation (NSF) Graduate Research Fellowship Program (GRFP). Topics include GRFP background, requesting letters of recommendation, writing your statements, other application components, and submitting your application.",
